cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the methods it builds on (references in docs/)."
type: software
title: "Wind UQ surrogate framework: UQ metrics and surrogate models for plant-level wind power uncertainty"
abstract: "UQ metrics for wind time series (temporal, data-source, ensemble and spatial) and a surrogate workflow that maps them to calibrated plant-level wind power uncertainty: pinball-loss-optimal scale targets at observed plants, Gaussian process and other surrogates, validation on held-out plants, and predictive quantiles at unobserved plants. Documented framework with synthetic examples and tests."
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Henryutd2021/wind-uq-surrogate"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Honglin
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8405-3032"
keywords:
  - wind energy
  - uncertainty quantification
  - surrogate model
  - Gaussian process regression
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - pinball loss
  - ensemble spread
  - variogram
